<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Petrobras announces dividends.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Petrobras announces dividends.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's oil giant Petrobras said it will pay dividends of six reais ($5.65) per 1,000 preferred shares.</p>
<p>The announcement was made late on Friday during a shareholders' meeting, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The company will also pay dividends of 1.41 reais per 1,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In 1996, Petrobras posted net earnings of 664 million reais.</p>
<p>1 real = $1.0614</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
